# GuardWork Recruiter invitation, membership, and notification APIs
# Run against a disposable local database at http://localhost:8080.
# Run requests selectively; this file has alternative accept/decline and remove/leave paths.
# The Owner's Company must be VERIFIED before issuing or resending an invitation.
# Invitation requests can send real email when Resend settings are exported to the backend process.
# See backend/.env.example and the GW-005 section in backend/README.md for configuration.
# A FAILED delivery leaves the invitation pending; configure delivery, then resend to get a fresh email.
# Owner APIs return delivery status, never the raw invitation secret.
# Copy the secret from the delivered email URL fragment after '#secret=' for recipient requests.
# No frontend invitation page is included; use these API requests to preview/accept/decline manually.
# Keep pasted tokens/secrets local; do not commit them in this file.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@ownerToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJnd19vd25lcl90ZXN0XzAxIiwiZW1haWwiOiJndy1vd25lci10ZXN0QGV4YW1wbGUudGVzdCIsInJvbGUiOiJVU0VSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyNTE1MzQ3LCJleHAiOjE3OTI1MTYyNDd9.K65ORpdKi1FlHvf8azxi4O_gyWAmfP_w62x57WmTPJw
@recipientToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI3IiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJmaW5uenhqZSIsImVtYWlsIjoiZmlubnp4amVAZ21haWwuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlVTRVIiLCJpYXQiOjE3OTI1MTYyMjcsImV4cCI6MTc5MjYwNjIyN30.ceegC3CtUtIO_iIpzy1wwtKFHr-1eI4lFGbrvZsI9fc
@recipientEmail = finnzxje@gmail.com
@recipientUsername = finnzxje
@recipientPassword = LocalTestPass123
@invitationId = 1
@invitationSecret = jixYI3UVM-UYJrj-p8Y6PjuG7biHlbkmZMXQGbKJMQw
@membershipId = REPLACE_WITH_RECRUITER_MEMBERSHIP_ID
@notificationId = REPLACE_WITH_NOTIFICATION_ID

### Confirm Owner context before managing invitations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### List this Company's invitations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/invitations?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Issue a Recruiter invitation (sends email when Resend settings are configured)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{recipientEmail}}"
}

### Resend an invitation (optional; sends another email and invalidates the previous secret)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/invitations/{{invitationId}}/resend
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Revoke a pending invitation (optional; do not run if you intend to accept it)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/invitations/{{invitationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Register the recipient (optional if the invited email already has an account)
### Use the exact email address that received the invitation.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Lan",
  "lastName": "Trần",
  "username": "{{recipientUsername}}",
  "email": "{{recipientEmail}}",
  "password": "{{recipientPassword}}"
}

### Log in as recipient; copy data.accessToken into @recipientToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "{{recipientEmail}}",
  "password": "{{recipientPassword}}"
}

### Preview the invitation using the secret copied from the email URL fragment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/company-invitations/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{recipientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "secret": "{{invitationSecret}}"
}

### Accept the invitation explicitly
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/company-invitations/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{recipientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "secret": "{{invitationSecret}}",
  "confirm": true
}

### Alternative to accept: decline the invitation instead
### Declining is final for this invitation; use a new invitation to test acceptance afterward.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/company-invitations/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{recipientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "secret": "{{invitationSecret}}"
}

### Confirm the recipient now has the Recruiter Company context
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{recipientToken}}

### Owner inbox: the accepted invitation creates a Recruiter-accepted notification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/notifications?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Mark an Owner notification read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/me/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### List active Company members; copy membershipId for the Recruiter row
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/members?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Owner removes the Recruiter (choose this OR Recruiter departure below)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/members/{{membershipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Alternative: Recruiter leaves voluntarily (do not run after Owner removal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/membership/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{recipientToken}}

### After removal/departure, the old token should have no active Company context
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{recipientToken}}

### Removed Recruiter can still read their own removal notification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/notifications?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{recipientToken}}

### Mark the Recruiter's removal notification read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/me/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{recipientToken}}
